        "root_concepts": "[cancer]",
        "section": "disease",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cancer",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CORE HALLMARKS:\n  1. Sustaining proliferative signaling       (grow without external signals)\n  2. Evading growth suppressors               (ignore stop signals)\n  3. Resisting cell death                     (apoptosis resistance)\n  4. Enabling replicative immortality         (telomerase, unlimited divisions)\n  5. Inducing / accessing vasculature         (angiogenesis for O₂/nutrients)\n  6. Activating invasion and metastasis       (escape primary tumor, colonize)\n  7. Reprogramming cellular metabolism        (Warburg effect, nutrient capture)\n  8. Evading immune destruction               (PD-L1, CTLA-4, immune exclusion)"
    },
